      "is_stub": false,
      "notes_md": "This song is known by any number of alternative names, including:\n- The Barbarian Birthday Dirge / The Barbarian Birthday Song\n- The Viking Birthday Dirge / The Viking Birthday Song\n- The Vulgar Birthday Song\n- The Mongolian Birthday Song\n- The SCA Birthday Song / The SCA Happy Birthday\n- HAPPY BIRTHDAY (THUD)",
      "version_notes_md": "There are numerous verses and numerous versions of the verses; the number of verses sung will depend on the occasion and on the tolerance of the birthday celebrant.\nAfter each 'happy birthday', it is traditional to either make a loud thud by dropping something heavy, stomp your feet, or literally say the word 'thud'.",
      "licensing_status": "unknown",
      "licensing_notes_md": "There is no known author for most of the SCA verses and they are presumed to belong to the public domain.",
